Status: Task 6 complete after profile migration, twelve bounded batches, and a
final relevant-Anvil closure review

Last verified: 2026-07-14 against the live local runtime and repositories

## Original Review Boundary

The initial inventory-only slice approved after Checkpoint C did not move,
delete, shrink, or disable any instruction source. Vik subsequently approved
the collaboration reconciliation and global shrink as separate bounded batches.

Non-goals that still apply:

- no edits to project `AGENTS.md` files;
- no hook or skill changes;
- no native Codex memory changes or disablement (Task 7);
- no skill-journal synthesis (Task 8);
- no routine or repeated Brain judge runs; the one explicitly authorized,
  scoped Codex closeout call has been consumed and must not be retried or
  expanded without new approval;
- no deletion of Continuity history or migration-driven compact-frame cleanup;
  routine phase-change hygiene remains separate.

